==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 40~53.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Kaoru Hanayama (Enemy)|Kaoru Hanayama]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

